          <p class="col-12 col-md-6">
            Real estate throughout the Metro Vancouver area tends to be among
            the most popular in the country, and in recent years housing
            prices have steadily trended upwards. It should come as no
            surprise then, that real estate investment is increasingly popular
            throughout the region, including in the suburbs of
            <strong>West Vancouver</strong>. Indeed, West Vancouver is one of
            the most desirable places to live in British Columbia with access
            to myriad outdoor activities, stunning natural landscapes, and
            proximity to the business and entertainment hubs of the City of
            Vancouver.

            <br /><br />
            Real estate investment in Horseshoe Bay, Chartwell, Rockridge and
            many more West Vancouver neighbourhoods can be lucrative
            particularly if you are considering investing in rental
            properties.
            <br /><br />

            Of course, managing a rental property is time consuming and
            requires specialized experience in tenant screening, selection,
            and retention, lease administration, building maintenance,
            financial reporting and much, much more. So then, many investors
            interested in the rental properties choose to work with
            <a href="https://www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com/">professional property management firms</a>
            such as VLR to manage all aspects of their rental property.

            <br /><br />
            VLR property management professionals do exactly what you might
            expect given their title – they oversee all aspects of a rental
            property from finding tenants and collecting rents to maintaining
            the property and all the administration that supports these tasks.
            VLR is the perfect <a href="https://www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com/west-vancouver-property-management/">West Vancouver
              property management</a> firm for anybody who wants to take the hassle out of investing in rental properties.
          </p>

